  - id: X:atem/1
    type: atem
    name: the mowing paragraph
    summary: Mowing the meadow strip in July would starve the orchard's pollinators.
    line: "Mowing the meadow strip in July would cut its wildflowers before they seed and starve the pollinators the orchard needs."
    focus: The date the parish council mows the meadow strip.
    push: Mow in September, after the wildflowers seed.
    pull: The council's grounds team wants the strip cut in July.
